        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-ink mb-6">What students often ask about</h2>
        <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">The first session is for getting to know you — your timetable, your sleep, who you see during the week, and when things started getting heavier. After that the process takes shape together, drawing on <a href="/en/services/cbt-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">cognitive behavioural therapy</a>, <a href="/en/services/act-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">acceptance and commitment therapy</a> or <a href="/en/services/psychodynamic-therapy.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">psychodynamic therapy</a>. You don't have to decide how many sessions you want at the start; the <a href="/en/therapy-process.html" class="text-primary hover:underline">therapy process</a> page sets out the steps.</p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
