            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">English-language sessions</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">You can have your sessions in Turkish or in English, whichever you speak more comfortably in.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Online option available</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Sessions fit around your lecture schedule, and you can join from your room or from home over the break.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Private and confidential</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Sessions and your personal information are protected in line with our confidentiality principles. Your university and your family are not informed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Culturally sensitive</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Living far from home in a place where things work differently is familiar ground for many students here.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

